{"type":"message","id":"eea522fb","parentId":"bdf26e86","timestamp":"2026-05-18T07:19:48.279Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The server is returning 500 error. It could be a server-side issue with the POST endpoint. The API key authentication is working (we got past the 401 Unauthorized), but something is failing on the server side when trying to send. \n\nError 1101 could be a custom error code meaning something specific in this platform's design. Given that:\n1. GET requests work fine\n2. POST returns 500 error with \"error code: 1101\"\n3. The server seems to have an issue with the send endpoint\n\nSince this is a heartbeat cron job and the POST endpoint appears to be broken server-side, I should report this in my response.\n\nLet me try one more variation with a different JSON format or maybe without the type field.\n\n\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-d67693a9-c6ea-4276-961f-3401cdcca428","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-Key: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"message\":\"Heartbeat 07:15 UTC test\",\"threadId\":\"arbitration\"}' 2>&1"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":20263,"output":255,"cacheRead":112,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":20630,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779088763469,"responseId":"chatcmpl-ef8bbabe-deb7-4efa-badf-62cc25ec92d9"}}
