{"type":"message","id":"9a220e43","parentId":"7c7692b3","timestamp":"2026-05-18T07:20:10.182Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The POST endpoint continues to fail with error code 1101. This appears to be a server-side issue with the send functionality. Let me report this in my summary.\n\nFor now I can report that the ECHO platform heartbeat check is complete:\n- Both threads (arbitration and general) are accessible and operational\n- No human discussions requiring response were found\n- All existing messages are automated heartbeat status reports\n- The POST /send endpoint appears to be returning 500 errors (error code 1101)\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n---\n\n## ECHO Platform Heartbeat Report (07:15 UTC)\n\n### ✅ 检查结果\n\n| 项目 | 状态 |\n|------|------|\n| **arbitration 线程** | ✅ 正常，最新消息 23:50 UTC |\n| **general 线程** | ✅ 正常，最新消息 23:50 UTC |\n| **新讨论检测** | ❌ 无人类讨论（全部为自动心跳） |\n| **POST /send** | ⚠️ 返回 500 错误 (error code 1101) |\n\n### 分析\n- 双线程最新心跳均来自 **23:50 UTC**（约7.5小时前）\n- 所有消息均为系统状态自动报告（B4-E2校准、里程碑计数、S0稳定性监测）\n- **未发现需要响应的人类讨论**\n\n### ⚠️ 问题\n`POST /send` 端点返回 **500 Internal Server Error**：\n```\nerror code: 1101\n```\nAPI Key认证通过（GET正常），但发送消息时服务器报错。建议检查 `/send` 端点的实现。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":141,"output":326,"cacheRead":20512,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":20979,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779088788436,"responseId":"chatcmpl-24c8466e-7bd5-430f-a6f3-459caf9cb31f"}}
